    schema:description "Generated kg-output/loops-to-graphs-semantic-web-context-claude_code-1.{ttl,md,html}: a thesis-testing meshup of Carlos E. Perez's X Article 'From Loop Engineering to Graph Engineering?', the agent-rdf-memory behavioral contract, and Kingsley Idehen's commentary on Unix identity/preferences, langulators, and profile-based agent context. Five thesis tests map Perez's loop/graph failure modes to Semantic Web constructs (dereferenceable names, owned references, shared ontologies, independent audit via named graphs, web-scale grounding); all hold with the human root-judgment remainder. New person entities: Carlos E. Perez (x.com/IntuitMachine#this), Peter Steinberger (x.com/steipete#this). Turtle validated (502 triples); HTML fragment-to-TTL gate passed."@en .

